Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《星际迷航10：复仇女神》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:45.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,参议员们 为了帝国 想想这些机遇吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senators, consider the opportunities for the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:50.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,最终 各星球的的命运将靠罗穆卢斯和瑞摩斯联合起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last, the destinies of the planets Romulus and Remus will be united.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞摩斯的辛藏将给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shinzon of Remus is offering us a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:56.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个使我们比以前更加强大的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make ourselves stronger than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,拒绝将是愚蠢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be madness to reject it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:03.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我恳求你们不要让偏见和政治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg you not to let prejudice or politics
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:06.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,影响了这次联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}interfere with this alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:08.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,和我们一起加入辛藏的的部队 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By joining Shinzon's forces with ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:11.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,就算联邦也无力阻碍我们... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not even the Federation will be able to stand in our way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:13.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,够了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:15.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,决议已经做出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The decision has been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:18.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,军队是不会听从罗穆卢斯的政策行事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The military does not dictate policy on Romulus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:23.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,参议院已经考虑了辛藏的提议并否决了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Senate has considered Shinzon's proposal and rejected it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:26.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,他和他的跟随者们将会遭到所有经过深思熟虑的力量的反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He and his followers will be met with all deliberate force
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:29.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,让他们回到他们黑石老家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sent back to that black rock they came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:34.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我讲清楚了吗? - 是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do I make myself clear? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:47.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果不介意 执政官 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you will excuse me, Praetor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:50.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我和索里大使有约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have an appointment with the Tholian ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:51.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,参议员们 还有谁要发言吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senators, are there any others who wish to speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:03.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么我建议对关于和瑟勒斯二世开放贸易谈判的提议进行投票表决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I call for a vote on the motion to open trade negotiations with Celes II.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.39,0:03:05.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们都知道 瑞曼的矿藏到现在已经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know, the Reman mines
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:08.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,数月没有供应他们的配额了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have not been filling their quotas for months now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.14,0:03:11.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你们牢牢记住贸易委员会的裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope that you will all bear in mind the trade committee's findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,就象我们不想要... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As much as we don't want...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:44.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁去叫下保卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would someone alert security?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:47.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,把特洛瑞参议员叫回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring back Senator Tal Aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:18.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:23.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,一艘星际飞船船长的生活充满了神圣的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A starship captain's life is filled with solemn duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:26.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我曾指挥船员们战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have commanded men in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:31.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我曾和死敌们进行和平条约的谈判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have negotiated peace treaties between implacable enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.85,0:04:33.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我曾代表联邦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have represented the Federation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:37.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,和27种外星物种进行首次接触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in first contact with 27 alien species.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:41.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是以前的这一切都不能我和今天神圣的职责相比... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But none of this compares with my solemn duty today...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.95,0:04:45.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,做一名伴郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as best man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:49.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我知道在这样的场合下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I know on an occasion such as this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:52.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我本该亲切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is expected that I be gracious
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:57.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,而由衷的祝福这对天作之合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and fulsome in my praise on the wonders of this blessed union.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:05:01.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是你们俩是否考虑过你们给我了什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But have the two of you considered what you are doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:05.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然 你们是快乐的 但是我呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you're happy, but what about my needs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:08.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,这简直就是一个该死的不便之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all a damned inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.55,0:05:13.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 当你们快乐的在泰坦号上定居的时候 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you're happily settling in on the Titan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:18.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,而我正在训练我新的大副 你们都认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be training my new First Officer. You all know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.56,0:05:21.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是专横而严格的人 从不也绝不会让我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a tyrannical martinet who will never
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:24.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,从不也绝不会让我放弃任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever allow me to go on away missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:27.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是规章 先生 星际舰队法规第四章第十二款... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the regulation, sir. Starfleet Code, Section 12, Paragraph...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:29.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 数据先生? - 长官?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr.Data. - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:31.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:37.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,这15年我一直想说那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen years I've been waiting to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:40.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:43.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,维尔 蒂安娜 要重新考虑还来得及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, Deanna, there's still time to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:45.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,要吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:47.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:50.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要? 哦 非常好 那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No? Oh, very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:59.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,维尔·瑞克 你作为我的得力助手已经15年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will Riker, you have been my trusted right arm for 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:04.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,你保证我的航线正确而平稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have kept my course true and steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:10.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,蒂安娜·婥维 你是我的向导和良知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deanna Troi, you've been my guide and my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:15.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,你帮助我认识到我自己优点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've helped me recognize the better parts of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:18.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们是我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:23.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,以船上的惯例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in best maritime tradition,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:27.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你们俩美好的开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you both clear horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:31.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的好朋友 去获取幸福吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My good friends, make it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:34.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,为新娘和新郎干杯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bride and groom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:36.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 为新娘和新郎干杯 - 为新娘和新郎干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To the bride and groom. 　- To the bride and groom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:56.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,你曾想过再婚吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever think about getting married again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:59.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有 23是我的界线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Twenty-three was my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:04.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃夫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worf?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:09.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗? - 若米兰酒应该被禁售\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right? - Romulan ale should be illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:16.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是个愉快的干杯 - 那是发自内心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was a lovely toast. - It was from the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:17.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you needn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:20.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你新的顾问详细地介绍她需要知道的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to brief your new counselor on everything she needs to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:24.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 就象你一样 你已经太了解我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, like hell you are. You already know too much about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:29.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是我认为在贝塔斯特的庆典期间我不会再做演讲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it that there will be no speeches during the ceremony on Betazed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.07,0:07:32.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 不演讲 也不用穿好衣服了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No speeches and no clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:38.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 以及受邀请的三性物种... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen and invited transgendered species,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:42.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在学习地球人和贝塔左德结婚习俗期间 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in my study of Terran and Betazoid conjugal rites
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:49.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我发现向快乐的新婚夫妇送礼物是一个传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've discovered it is traditional to present the happy couple with a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:53.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到瑞克指挥官对古典音乐的偏爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Given Commander Riker's affection for archaic musical forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:56.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我选了下面这首歌作为我给他们的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have elected to present the following as my gift
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:07:59.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,为他们的结合表示祝贺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in honor of their conjugation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:01.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,结合!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conjugation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:05.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从来没见过太阳照耀出如此光亮 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Never saw the sun shining so bright ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:08.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从来没见过事情发展如此顺利 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Never saw things going so right ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:12.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 注意到日子匆匆忙忙 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Noticing the days hurrying by ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:16.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 当你沉入爱河中 呀 他们是怎样飞上 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ When you're in love, my how they fly ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:21.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 噢 蓝色的天空对着我笑 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Blue skies Smiling at me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:23.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,欧文·柏林... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irving Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:28.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我能看见的只有蓝色的天空 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Nothing but blue skies Do I see ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:55.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是传统 沃夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's tradition, Worf.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你 以及其他人 应该懂得那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, of all people, should appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:59.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会这样做的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:01.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,不做什么 沃夫先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't do what, Mr.Worf?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:04.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我认为对于一个星际战舰的船员来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I do not think it is appropriate
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:07.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,赤裸出现是不恰当的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a Starfleet officer to appear naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:08.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:13.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,像你这样一位高大 帅气 魁梧的家伙? 你还害怕什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A big, handsome, strapping fellow like you? What can you be afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:22.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我从科洛仁系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I'm picking up an unusual electromagnetic signature
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:23.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,获得一个罕见的电磁信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the Kolarin system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:27.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么类型的信号? - 正电子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What sort of signature? - Positronic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:37.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,它非常微弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very faint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:41.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是我已经把它从科洛仁系的第三行星里隔离出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've isolated it to the third planet in the Kolarin system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:43.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们对它有什么了解? - 未知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do we know about it? - Uncharted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:46.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得靠的更近一下以获得更详细的扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to get closer for a more detailed scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:47.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么意见?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theories?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,对于只有像我这样的机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since positronic signatures have only been known to emanate
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:51.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,才会发出正电子信息来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from androids such as myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:55.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,合理的推测就是在科洛仁三号上有一个机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is logical to theorize there is an android on Kolarus III.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:58.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,正如我担心的 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what I was afraid of. Captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:00.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,向科洛仁系的转移\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}diverting to the Kolarin system
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:03.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,使我们离若米兰中心区非常的近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}takes us awfully close to the Romulan Neutral Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:09.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我们这面依然是好的 我认为 呃...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's still well on our side. I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:15.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认为很值得去看看 不要担心 大副\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's worth taking a look. Don't worry, Number One.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:17.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们依然需要你到贝塔斯德去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll still have you to Betazed with plenty of time to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:19.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:22.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,那儿我们将的尊重贝塔斯德的传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where we will all honor the Betazoid tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:26.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在 如果你不介意 我要去健身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you'll excuse me, I'll be in the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:37.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,布朗森先生 确定一条到科洛仁系的路线 5号航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Branson, lay in a course for the Kolarin system, warp 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:44.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么看法吗 数据? 一位失踪多年的亲戚?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, Data? A long-lost relative?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:05.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在这个行星的表面超过好几公里的范围处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm reading six distinct positronic signatures
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:08.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,发现了六个不同地方发出正电子信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spread out over a few kilometers on the planet's surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:10.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道多少关于科洛仁三号行星人口的消息?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we know about the population of Kolarus III?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:12.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,有小群的孤立的星球人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isolated pockets of humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:14.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,看上去是一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears to be a pre-warp civilization
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:17.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,在工业发展早期被歪曲了的文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at an early stage of industrial development.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:20.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我建议不要使用传输机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I wouldn't recommend using the transporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:22.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,那些离子风暴看起来不怎么友好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ion storm doesn't look very neighborly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:25.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,它可能没有太多警告的情况下 出现在我们面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could head in our direction without much warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:26.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:36.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 数据 沃夫先生 你们和我一起 - 船长 我不得不提醒你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Data, Mr.Worf, you're with me. - Captain, I don't have to remind you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:38.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很感激你的关心 大副\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate your concern, Number One.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.19,0:11:43.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是 呃 我已经渴望试试坐一下这个亚尔古舟了 - 我打赌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I've been itching to try the Argo. - I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:46.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长的特权 那有不可预知的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's prerogative. There's no foreseeable danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:51.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你发生了什么不测 你的妻子可决不会原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your wife would never forgive me if anything were to happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.83,0:11:54.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你来控制飞船... 婥维先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the Bridge, Mr.Troi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:04.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我总是对人类以不安全的速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will always be puzzled by the human predilection
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:07.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,来驾驶交通工具感到迷惑不解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for piloting vehicles at unsafe velocities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:15.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,那高出的地方 长官 半公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over that rise, sir. Half a kilometer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:43.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,电磁射线范围在我的 三角自动记录器上乱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The radiant electromagnetic field is interfering with my tricorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:45.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我们离信号只有几米的距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are within a few meters of the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:48.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,把它找出来 让我们仔细找找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fan out. Let's search around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:31.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这好像是个机械手 - 非常正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It appears to be a robotic arm. - Very astute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃夫先生 把它带到车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Worf, bring it to the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:08.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,这好像有点不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:21.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个信号大约在北方100米处 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The final signature is approximately 100 meters to the north, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:52.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:57.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,惊人的相似\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The resemblance is striking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:10.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 太神奇了 - 太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fascinating. - Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.26,0:16:16.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.19,0:16:26.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想是试试危险速度的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's time to try some unsafe velocities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:48.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你有一个发亮的头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you have a shiny head?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:51.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在不是交谈的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the appropriate time for a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:54.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为船长必须集中精力驾驶这辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the Captain has to concentrate on piloting the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:56.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么? - 因为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:57.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,数据!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Data!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:16:59.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:04.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说错什么了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have I said something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:48.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:50.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:55.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 全面考虑来看 数据 我认为你的那双眼睛更漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, all things considered, Data, I think you have nicer eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:19:00.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的眼睛是一样的 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our eyes are identical, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:04.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们获得些什么信息 郭蒂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what have we got, Geordi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:08.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我得说他有和数据一样的内部机械结构 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say he has the same internal mechanics as Data
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:10.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是正电子的设计水平不如数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not as much positronic development.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:12.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,神经系统线路不是很复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The neural pathways aren't nearly as sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.94,0:19:14.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是说他是一个原型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say he's a prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:17.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,可能宋博士在制造数据之前创造的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something Dr. Soong created prior to Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:20.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有名字吗 先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a name, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:23.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我叫B-4\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am B-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:26.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,B-四?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-4?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:30.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,宋博士老是取一些古怪的名字 好像没有终结似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Soong's penchant for whimsical names seems to have no end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:35.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能告诉我们你怎么到我们发现你的那颗行星上的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell us how you came to be on the planet where we found you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:37.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:41.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得一些在你到那颗星球上前你是怎么样的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember anything of your life before you were on the planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:46.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不记得了 - 为什么那个高个有一脸的络腮胡子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Why does the tall man have a furry face?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:53.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,大副 随时向我报告 呃 郭蒂 重新把他组装起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number One, keep me informed. And, Geordi, reassemble him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:54.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:01.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,B-4 你知道我是谁吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-4, do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:06.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我叫数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:18.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,伯爵灰茶 热的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tea, Earl Grey, hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:26.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 你有一个来自星际舰队指挥部来的最高级通信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, you have an Alpha Priority communication from Starfleet Command
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:29.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,接通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:37.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,简维舰队司令 很高兴再次见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral Janeway, how good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:40.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,吉恩·卢克 你在罗穆卢斯旅行怎么样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jean-Luc. How would you like a trip to Romulus?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:44.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 包不包括剩下的舰队? - 一次外交任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With or without the rest of the fleet? - A diplomatic mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:47.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经受到邀请了 信不信由你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been invited, believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:50.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,好像出现了一些内部政治动荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems there's been some kind of internal political shake-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:53.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,新的执政官 一些人叫他辛藏 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new Praetor, someone called Shinzon,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:56.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,已经邀请一位联邦使节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has requested a Federation envoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:21:00.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 新的执政官? - 这还有更多消息 他是瑞曼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- New Praetor? - Here's more. He's Reman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:03.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我们对此也不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, we don't understand it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:04.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是离他最近的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the closest ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:07.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,因此我想你去听听他要说些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I want you to go and hear what he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:08.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,考察一下他是否真的有诚意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the lay of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:13.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果帝国变得不稳定的话 会对整个宇宙造成麻烦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the Empire becomes unstable, it could mean trouble for the entire quadrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:14.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.81,0:21:17.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在向你发出我们所有的情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're sending you all the intelligence we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.36,0:21:19.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是依然不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:22.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,不用我告诉你要注意背后的情况了吧 吉恩·卢克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need to tell you to watch your back, Jean-Luc.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.15,0:21:23.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.49,0:21:26.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,索纳人 伯济人 若米兰人... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Son'a, the Borg, the Romulans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:29.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好像总是得到所有这些容易的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to get all the easy assignments.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:30.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,只是运气 舰队司令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just lucky, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.87,0:21:33.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,希望运气常在 简维中断通讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hope that luck holds. Janeway out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:45.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,舵手 绘出新的路线 我们去罗穆卢斯 8号航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helmsman, lay in a new course. Take us to Romulus. Warp 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.97,0:21:50.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 路线绘制并载入 - 罗穆卢斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aye-aye, sir. Course plotted and laid in. - Romulus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:53.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕奥珀尔海的事必须等等了 大副\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid The Opal Sea will have to wait, Number One.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.14,0:21:54.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:10.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以看出 瑞摩斯星的一面总是面对太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, one side of Remus always faces the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:14.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,由于他们的世界一半处在极高的温度下 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Due to the extreme temperatures on that half of their world,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:16.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以瑞曼人总是生活在这行星黑暗面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Remans live on the dark side of the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:21.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,虽然通过智能扫描证明这颗星球的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost nothing is known of the Reman homeworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.17,0:22:23.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,蒂里塞矿藏和重型武器制造方面很发达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}although intelligence scans have proven
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:26.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我们对瑞曼人家园几乎还是一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the existence of dilithium mining and heavy weapons construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.59,0:22:30.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞曼人他们自己也认为他们帝国的等级制度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Remans themselves are considered
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:33.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,非常不受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an undesirable caste in the hierarchy of the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.81,0:22:36.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是他们也因在主权战争中强大的战士而名声大噪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they also have a reputation for being formidable warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:40.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞曼人的部队在过去大多数激烈的战争中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the Dominion War, Reman troops were used as assault forces
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.27,0:22:41.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,通常扮演着进攻的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the most violent encounters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:43.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,炮灰而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cannon fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:46.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但一个瑞曼人怎么成为执政官的呢? 我搞不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but how did a Reman get to be Praetor? I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.99,0:22:49.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不得不假设他有若米兰人的合作者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to assume he had Romulan collaborators.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:50.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coup d'état?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.61,0:22:52.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,执政官的力量总是是若米兰人的舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Praetor's power has always been the Romulan fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.95,0:22:56.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们一定是在辛藏的幕后并帮他推翻了参议院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have been behind Shinzon for him to have overthrown the Senate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:58.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们对辛藏了解多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have we learned about Shinzon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.29,0:23:00.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,星际舰队情报部只能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet intelligence was only able to provide
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:02.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,提供他的部分军事记录报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a partial account of his military record.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:05.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以推断他是一位比较年轻而能干的指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can infer he is relatively young and a capable commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:09.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,在战争中他打了12场主要的战役 全都获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fought 12 major engagements in the war. All successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.63,0:23:11.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,除此之外 我们一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond that, we know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:15.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,喔 看起来好像我们真的是在向未知的地区航行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it seems as though we're truly sailing into the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.27,0:23:21.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,加油干 我会很感激你们所能提供的一切 散会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep at it. Anything you can give me will be appreciated. Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.73,0:23:26.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我依然不敢相信船长会同意下载记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still can't believe the Captain went along with a memory download.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:30.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,皮卡特船长同意是因为 B-4很可能是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Picard agrees that the B-4 was probably designed
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:34.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,和我一样都是自我改进型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the same self-actualization parameters as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:40.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的记忆痕迹能成功的整合到他的正电子矩阵中去 他应该能获得我所有的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my memory engrams are successfully integrated into his positronic matrix,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:42.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,他应该能获得我所有的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he should have all my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:46.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但是他也会同样拥有你所有的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. But he would also have all of your memories as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:50.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你对那个感觉舒服吗? - 我什么也感觉不到 郭蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You feel comfortable with that? - I feel nothing, Geordi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.01,0:23:53.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我相信只要他拥有了我的记忆痕迹 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my belief that with my memory engrams
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.89,0:23:57.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,他将能成为更加完全的个体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'll be able to function as a more complete individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.35,0:24:00.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是说 一个和你差不多的个体 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- An individual more like you, you mean? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.52,0:24:07.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,可能他不会像你 数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's not supposed to be like you, Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.78,0:24:11.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,可能他有他自己的行为方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's supposed to be exactly the way he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.11,0:24:13.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,也有可能 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That might be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:17.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是我认为他应该有开发他潜能的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I believe he should have the opportunity to explore his potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.75,0:24:22.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我们完成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.67,0:24:33.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,B-4 你知道你在哪里吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-4, do you know where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.76,0:24:37.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在一间充满灯光的房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am in a room with lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.72,0:24:43.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,你记得我们的父亲吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you remember our father?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.15,0:24:47.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们的父亲? - 是的 宋博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our father? - Yes. Dr. Soong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.28,0:24:50.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:54.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这艘飞船的船长的名字吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know the name of the Captain of this vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.20,0:24:57.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长... 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.66,0:25:03.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,数据 他刚刚载入了许多程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Data, he's assimilating a lot of programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.17,0:25:07.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,记住 他是个原型 远不及你复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, he's a prototype, a lot less sophisticated than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.42,0:25:09.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是不知道是否他的矩阵能否适应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just don't know if his matrix will be able to adapt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:12.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我真的需要给他一些时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We really need to give him some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.59,0:25:16.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,郭蒂 这个是干什么用的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geordi, what purpose does this serve?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.09,0:25:18.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - This.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.64,0:25:21.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是一个多余的记忆接口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a redundant memory port.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.39,0:25:26.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,可能是临时的记忆存储器以防他的神经线路过载\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the provisional memory storage is in case his neural pathways overload.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.73,0:25:29.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意我把他留在这里一会儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if I keep him here for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.19,0:25:30.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,进行一些诊断?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run a few diagnostics?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.28,0:25:32.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I do not mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.69,0:25:34.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.65,0:25:38.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 你必须留下来和拉佛吉指挥官待在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You must remain with Commander La Forge.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.53,0:25:40.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,他会帮助你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is going to try to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.29,0:25:53.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长日志 星际日期 56844.9\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's Log. Stardate 56844.9.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:56.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,企业号已经达到罗穆卢斯星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise has arrived at Romulus
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.97,0:25:59.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,正在等待指派坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is waiting at the designated coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.97,0:26:02.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们发出的所有友好信息都没有得到回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All our hails have gone unanswered.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.31,0:26:05.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经等了17小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been waiting for 17 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.98,0:26:15.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 顾问? - 他们在外面 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Counselor? - They're out there, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.42,0:26:35.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我建议升起防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I recommend we raise shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.01,0:26:37.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,不急 沃夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet, Mr.Worf.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.38,0:26:41.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 虽然因该尊重外交协议 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, with all due respect to diplomatic protocol,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.30,0:26:44.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,但联邦议会没有坐在这里 而我们在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Federation Council isn't sitting out here, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.85,0:26:48.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,耐心 外交是一个需付出极大耐心职业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience. Diplomacy is a very exacting occupation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.89,0:26:50.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得等待 - 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We will wait. - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.95,0:26:59.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 升起防护罩 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Raising shields. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.53,0:27:02.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 船长 - 战术分析 沃夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain. - Tactical analysis, Mr.Worf.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.87,0:27:08.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,52个干扰箱 27个光子鱼雷炸弹舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty-two disruptor banks, 27 photon torpedo bays,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.96,0:27:11.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,一级和二级防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}primary and secondary shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.30,0:27:15.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,她是一个掠夺者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.43,0:27:30.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到通讯联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are being hailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.89,0:27:32.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,接到屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On-screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.82,0:27:38.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,企业号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enterprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.40,0:27:44.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是瑞曼人的单刃刀号战舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are the Reman warbird, Scimitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.99,0:27:48.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 执政官辛藏 我很高兴... - 我不是辛藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Praetor Shinzon, I'm pleased to... - I am not Shinzon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.33,0:27:52.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是他的副手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am his viceroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.92,0:27:56.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们会发出一个传送坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are sending transport coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.34,0:28:04.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 废话倒很少 - 谈判队到4号传送室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not very chatty. - Away team, Transporter Room 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.14,0:28:53.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能原谅这里的黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you'll forgive the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.60,0:28:58.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们对光线感到不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not comfortable in the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.82,0:29:03.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 执政官辛藏? - 船长皮卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Praetor Shinzon? - Captain Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.41,0:29:08.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,吉恩·卢克·皮卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jean-Luc Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.37,0:29:15.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一直以为你应该更高些 是不是很奇怪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd always imagined you a little taller. Isn't that odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.09,0:29:21.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不用偷偷摸摸的扫描我 数据指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you may scan me without subterfuge, Commander Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.10,0:29:37.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你和我想象中的不一样 - 不一样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are not as we imagined you. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.69,0:29:39.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are human.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.78,0:29:47.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么叫我们到这里来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why have you asked us to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.70,0:29:50.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,执政官?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praetor?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.87,0:29:56.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我从来没有见过人类女性 - 我只是半人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've never met a human woman before. - I'm only half human.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.67,0:29:59.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,来自贝塔斯德的蒂安娜·婥维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deanna Troi of Betazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.59,0:30:04.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,有移情和心灵感应能力 飞船的顾问 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Empathic and telepathic abilities. Ship's counselor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.55,0:30:09.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,只是我知道的一切 但我从来没有想到你是如此漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this I knew. But I never knew you were so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.43,0:30:12.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好像对我们各个船员非常的熟悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem quite familiar with our personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.35,0:30:14.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我是 瑞克指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I am, Commander Riker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.81,0:30:18.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以摸摸你的头发吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I touch your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.23,0:30:22.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们到罗穆卢斯星是来解决有关重大问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We came to Romulus on a matter we were assured was of great importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.07,0:30:24.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你对作为联邦代表的我们有什么话要说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you have anything to say to usas representatives of the Federation,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.82,0:30:28.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你现在就说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.24,0:30:32.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 对不起 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I'm sorry, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:35.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要谈的太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is so much we need to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.41,0:30:38.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很想知道我们要谈些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would be interested to know what we are talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.25,0:30:40.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,联合 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unity, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.04,0:30:45.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,推倒我们之间的隔阂之墙重新承认我们是一体的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tearing down the walls between us to recognize that we are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.18,0:30:50.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我正说的是使我们变成一样的事情... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking of the thing that makes us the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.35,0:30:55.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,和平 我们想要和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peace. We want peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:04.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在 你肯定认为这一切听起来难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now you're thinking this all sounds too good to be true,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.65,0:31:06.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是你也在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you're also thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:09.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,大有希望的和平机会是不能忽视的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the chance for peace is too promising to ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.49,0:31:13.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说的对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.91,0:31:17.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.54,0:31:22.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,或许是我们该打个照面的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, perhaps it's time to add some illumination to our discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.79,0:31:25.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,电脑 把照明提高到4级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, raise the lighting four levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.06,0:31:44.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我还很小的时候 我患一种奇怪的病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was very young, I was stricken with an odd disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.28,0:31:49.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对声音极其敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I developed a hyper-sensitivity to sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.99,0:31:52.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,使得最轻微的耳语也会对我造成的极大痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the slightest whisper caused me agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:54.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有人知道该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one could do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.91,0:31:59.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,最后 我被带去看一个医生 他对地球人的疾病有一些经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally, I was taken to a doctor who had some experience of Terran illnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.50,0:32:02.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,他诊断我得了夏拉夫特综合症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he diagnosed me with Shalaft's Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:06.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那个吗 船长?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know of it, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.22,0:32:13.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.76,0:32:17.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么你知道那是一种非常罕见的综合症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you know it's a very rare syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.22,0:32:19.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,遗传的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.93,0:32:24.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,显而易见 家庭的所有男性成员都会得这种病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, all the male members of a family have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:30.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,最终 我被治愈了 所以现在我能像你一样听了 船长 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually, I was treated and now I can hear as well as you can, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.53,0:32:34.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能像你一样看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see as well as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.37,0:32:38.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉一切你所感觉的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel everything you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.25,0:32:41.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,实际上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:46.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 我和你的感觉一模一样... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel exactly what you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.71,0:32:49.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗 吉恩·卢克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't I, Jean-Luc?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.88,0:32:55.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,明天来罗穆卢斯星上用餐吧 只有我们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to dinner tomorrow on Romulus. Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.89,0:33:00.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,或者我应该说 只有我们一个人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or should I say, just the one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.24,0:33:18.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想你正想要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you'll be wanting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.25,0:33:26.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,明天见 船长 我们有许多要讨论的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until tomorrow then, Captain. We have much to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.59,0:33:33.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,电脑 把照明恢复到初始水平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, return lighting to previous level.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.62,0:34:06.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 船长 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no doubt, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:09.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,这正是你那夏拉夫特综合症所具有的好斗性情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right down to your aggressive strain of Shalaft's Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.71,0:34:11.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是一个克隆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:14.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能用了一根发囊或者一些皮肤细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They probably used a hair follicle or a skin cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.17,0:34:19.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么? - 我会找到答案的 大副\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - I intend to find out, Number One.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.30,0:34:22.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,向星际舰队通报这个情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inform Starfleet of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.14,0:34:25.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道他到底是从哪里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know where the hell he came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.89,0:34:29.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Counselor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.94,0:34:36.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们支持你 辛藏 当你暗杀参议员时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We supported you, Shinzon, when you assassinated the Senate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.65,0:34:40.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我们是进攻联邦的最好时机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told us the timing was perfect for an attack on the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.62,0:34:43.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白为什么现在你推迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand why now you delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.33,0:34:45.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不必明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.75,0:34:47.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,并且把企业号 带到了这里 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bringing the Enterprise here,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.54,0:34:49.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,这样做的目的是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what possible purpose could that serve?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.50,0:34:52.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有一个打算 - 那或许你会开导一下我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have a purpose. - Then, perhaps you'll enlighten us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.92,0:34:54.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,你给我安静点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence, Romulan!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.51,0:35:05.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真该学一下耐性了 指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really must learn patience, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.27,0:35:11.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,过一下每天18小时在一位若米兰护卫鞭打下的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spend 18 hours every day under the lash of a Romulan guard
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.77,0:35:14.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,或许你很快就会明白什么是耐性了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you'll soon understand patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.15,0:35:18.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,给我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.75,0:35:29.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,德纳储指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Donatra.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.37,0:35:32.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,请留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.55,0:35:45.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,有个词我希望你考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a word I want you to consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.35,0:35:50.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,忠诚 这是我对那些为我服务的人的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allegiance. It's something I demand from those who serve me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.06,0:35:53.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我为你服务吗? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do I serve you? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.86,0:35:56.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,并且我诚恳地认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, I think, faithfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.44,0:36:00.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑟闰指挥官 从另一方面来说... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Suran, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.28,0:36:02.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我犹豫不定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gives me pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.41,0:36:05.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,这有另外一个词 执政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's another word, Praetor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.70,0:36:08.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.75,0:36:13.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,你信任我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.21,0:36:17.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,到底有多信任?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far does that trust extend?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.26,0:36:21.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,到底能多信任?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How deep does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.93,0:36:27.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,一位指挥官必须做些什么来证明她自己对你的忠诚呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What must a commander do to prove herself faithful to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.35,0:36:31.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个女人又必须怎么证明呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What must a woman do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.56,0:36:36.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是一个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.32,0:36:39.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只是一个若米兰人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a Romulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.32,0:36:43.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,忠诚的为我服务 你会得到奖赏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serve me faithfully and you will be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.70,0:36:48.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,那双可爱的眼睛好好看着瑟闰指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep those lovely eyes on Commander Suran.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.45,0:36:53.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要一发现他有背叛的迹象... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And at the first sign of treachery...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.13,0:36:59.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,就干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dispose of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.13,0:37:03.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你就能证明你自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you will have proven yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.47,0:37:12.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.15,0:37:24.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有 指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.91,0:37:31.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你再碰到我 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you ever touch me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:35.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会杀了你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.74,0:38:50.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,不知若米兰人怎么得到你的DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Romulans had somehow gained possession of your DNA
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.57,0:38:52.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,因此我就被创造了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I had been created.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.58,0:38:56.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,一旦我准备好了 他们就会用我来替代你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I was ready, they were going to replace you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.50,0:39:01.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,把一位若米兰的代表放在星际舰队的核心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put a Romulan agent at the heart of Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.00,0:39:04.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是一个大胆的计划 - 然后发生了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was a bold plan. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.30,0:39:07.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像在罗穆卢斯星这里经常发生一样... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As happens frequently on Romulus,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.26,0:39:12.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个新的政府获得了权利 他们决定放弃这个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a new government came to power. They decided to abandon the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.05,0:39:15.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们害怕我可能被发现 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were afraid that I might be discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.81,0:39:17.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,并将导致战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that it would lead to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.56,0:39:24.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,和你记忆中那张脸不太一样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite the face you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.74,0:39:28.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,不太一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.74,0:39:31.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,一生的暴虐造就了这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lifetime of violence will do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.57,0:39:34.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们打破了我的鼻子 我的下巴...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They broke my nose, my jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.20,0:39:37.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是还是有那么多一样的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But so much is the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:39.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.87,0:39:44.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你肯定认得这双眼睛 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Surely you recognize the eyes? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.63,0:39:47.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的眼睛反映了我们的一生 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our eyes reflect our lives, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.84,0:39:50.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼睛是如此的自信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yours are so confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.97,0:39:59.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,因此我没有你期望的那么高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I'm not as tall as you expected?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.06,0:40:03.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我总是希望我能达到2米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had always hoped I might hit two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.65,0:40:04.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,也希望我那么高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As had I.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.49,0:40:11.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么到瑞摩斯星上的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you end up on Remus?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.87,0:40:15.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们把我送到那儿去等死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sent me there to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.62,0:40:21.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,区区一个人类怎么能在蒂里塞矿藏存活下去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could a mere human survive the dilithium mines?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.33,0:40:23.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,那倒不是什么要紧的 但我却再不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that it mattered
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.83,0:40:27.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们对抗联邦计划一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I was no longer part of their plans against the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.46,0:40:32.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,在那些只有该死的人生活的可怕的深度下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In those terrible depths lived only the damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.47,0:40:35.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,和那些瑞曼奴隶一起 我被定了罪 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together with the Reman slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.30,0:40:38.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,在若米兰护卫的寸步不离的监视下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was condemned to an existence of unceasing labor and starvation
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.85,0:40:41.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,进行持续劳动并且遭受饥饿的的折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under the brutal heel of the Romulan guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.35,0:40:45.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有最最强壮的人才有生存的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the very strongest had any hope of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.94,0:40:48.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,当他们把我带到那儿时 我仅仅只是一个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was only a child when they took me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.15,0:40:52.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,从那时起我就近10年的时间再也没有见过太阳和星星了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I didn't see the sun or the stars again for nearly 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.53,0:40:59.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,若米兰护卫唯一比讨厌瑞曼人更讨厌的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing the Romulan guards hated more than the Remans
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.04,0:41:01.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.71,0:41:08.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是有一个人可怜了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But one man took pity on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.76,0:41:13.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,这人以后成为了我的总督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man that became my viceroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.55,0:41:17.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,他从那些残酷的护卫下保护了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He protected me from the cruelty of the guards
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.39,0:41:20.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,并教会我如何生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and taught me how to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.39,0:41:25.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,在那黑暗的地方 我自己什么也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in that dark place where there was nothing of myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.10,0:41:28.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了我的瑞曼兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found my Reman brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.15,0:41:35.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们给了我所知道的唯一真正的仁慈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They showed me the only true kindness I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.91,0:41:38.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,你这样做是为了解放瑞曼人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing this to liberate the Remans?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.49,0:41:42.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是我所做的一切之后唯一的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the single thought behind everything I have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.58,0:41:46.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,从在一个秘密基地建立单刃刀号 到组建我的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From building the Scimitarat a secret base to assembling my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.33,0:41:48.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,最终武力占领罗穆卢斯星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally, coming to Romulus in force.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.25,0:41:53.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他们决不会给我们自由 我必须争取它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew they would never give us our freedom. I would have to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.09,0:41:56.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么为了你的自由死了多少若米兰人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many Romulans died for your freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.34,0:41:59.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.72,0:42:04.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是关键是 最终帝国逐渐认识到会有一个更好的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the point is that finally the Empire is realizing that there is a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.10,0:42:06.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,那个办法就是和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that way is peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.61,0:42:16.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不相信我 - 我没有理由相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't trust me. - I have no reason to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.95,0:42:18.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有充分的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have every reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.82,0:42:23.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你经历了我的生活以及体验了我人民的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you had lived my life and experienced the suffering of my people
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.12,0:42:26.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你将会站到我这边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd be standing where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.79,0:42:28.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,同样要是你经历了我的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you had lived my life
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.12,0:42:31.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也会明白我的对联邦的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you would understand my responsibility to the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.17,0:42:36.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让我的个人感情 不恰当地影响了我决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot allow my personal feelings to unduly influence my decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.09,0:42:39.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我所有的一切都是我的个人感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I have are my personal feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.14,0:42:48.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想要知道做为人类的意义是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know what it means to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.94,0:42:51.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞曼人给了我未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Remans have given me a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.69,0:42:57.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是我能告诉你我的过去 - 我可以告诉你我的过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you can tell me about my past. - I can tell you about my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.70,0:43:03.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们皮卡特族人都是勇士吗? - 我想我自己是个探险家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Were we Picards always warriors? - I think of myself as an explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.83,0:43:06.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们一直是探险家了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were we always explorers?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.67,0:43:11.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是第一个离开太阳系的皮卡特族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the first Picard to leave our solar system.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.67,0:43:15.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,在家族里还引起了不小的轰动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It caused quite a stir in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.09,0:43:20.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是我把我的青春花在了... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'd spent my youth...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.18,0:43:25.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,仰望天上星星梦想有关上面的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking up at the stars, dreaming about what was up there, about...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.27,0:43:26.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,梦想新世界 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.99,0:43:43.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我努力相信你 辛藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to believe you, Shinzon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.95,0:43:51.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,联邦有个最美好的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is one ideal that the Federation holds most dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.83,0:43:54.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,让所有的人 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is that all men,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.75,0:43:57.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有的种族都能联合起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all races, can be united.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.51,0:44:01.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,有什么比一位星际舰队船长站在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What better example?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.80,0:44:06.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,若米兰参议院更好的例子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Starfleet captain standing in the Romulan Senate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.81,0:44:15.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么能让我感到比友好的握着你的手更自豪的事了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing would make me more proud than to take your hand in friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.23,0:44:18.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,渐渐地 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.49,0:44:22.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,信任将积累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When that trust has been earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.41,0:44:31.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 在主电脑中我们遭到一个没有授权的侵入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we have had an unauthorized access into the main computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.25,0:44:32.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,来源?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Source?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.46,0:44:34.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,需要花些时间来确认 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna take some time to figure that out, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.83,0:44:38.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,数据流是经过所有飞船的分站改道发送来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The data stream was re-routed through sub-stations all over the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.13,0:44:42.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 用什么程序侵入的? - 那正是我不能确定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What programs were accessed? - That's what I can't figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.88,0:44:45.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,好像是基本的恒星绘图法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's mostly just basic stellar cartography.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.26,0:44:47.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,从殖民太空跟踪站通过星象图 通信协议 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Star charts, communications protocols,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.56,0:44:49.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,以及一些卫星上行链路发出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some uplinks from colony tracking stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.31,0:44:51.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,并不是禁用物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not even restricted material.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.23,0:44:53.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎么样 我们必须找到来源 及时向我报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevertheless, we must learn the source. Keep me informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.06,0:44:56.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 还有些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.61,0:45:00.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我重新检查了一下传感器日志 看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was reviewing the sensor logs. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.94,0:45:03.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,当单刃刀号显形时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the Scimitarde-cloaked,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.28,0:45:06.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,在第三段电磁波段上出现了瞬时的突起 那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was a momentary spike in the tertiary EM band. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.66,0:45:11.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,你无法想象吧 是瑟拉昂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going to believe this. It's thalaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.46,0:45:18.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我本以为瑟拉昂射线是理论上存在的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought thalaron radiation was theoretical.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.21,0:45:21.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我们最初的扫描没有发现它 但是他们找到了 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why our initial scans didn't pick it up. But he's got it, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.80,0:45:24.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑟拉昂研究在联邦是被禁止的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thalaron research was banned in the Federation
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.13,0:45:26.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为它的生物特性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because of its biogenic properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.09,0:45:30.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,它在亚原子水平上有毁灭有机体的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has the ability to consume organic material at the subatomic level.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.43,0:45:34.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不能过高估计瑟拉昂射线的危险 吉恩·卢克.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't overestimate the danger of thalaron radiation, Jean-Luc.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.56,0:45:37.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,极小的数量就能在几秒种内就能杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A microscopic amount could kill every living thing
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.19,0:45:38.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,这艘飞船上的所有生命体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on this ship in a matter of seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.98,0:45:40.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 继续监视它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand. Keep on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.48,0:45:45.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道他拥有什么以及我们能如何对付他的任何威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know what he has and how we can neutralize any threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.53,0:45:46.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要更多的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need options.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.00,0:46:03.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个错误 我们正在浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was a mistake. We're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.38,0:46:06.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.68,0:46:09.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会选择怎么花它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I shall spend it how I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.76,0:46:12.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要忘了我们的任务 辛藏.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not forget our mission, Shinzon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.43,0:46:15.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须行动了 立刻!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must act. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.07,0:46:24.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们回单刃刀号去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll return to the Scimitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.90,0:46:28.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只是对他很好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was merely curious about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.38,0:46:44.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.22,0:46:48.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗莉 请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beverly, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.06,0:46:54.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,记得他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember him?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.73,0:47:01.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我记忆里他有点傲慢 - 他是个十足的笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was a bit cocky, as I recall. - He was a damned fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.06,0:47:05.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,自私 野心勃勃 缺乏见识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selfish. Ambitious. Very much in need of seasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.74,0:47:08.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,他变好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He turned out all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.62,0:47:14.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很想相信辛藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really wanted to believe Shinzon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:20.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是这个瑟拉昂射线很难解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this thalaron radiation just can't be explained away.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.59,0:47:26.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,不论他在追寻什么 但肯定不是和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever he's after, it isn't peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.51,0:47:29.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是不是跟你过去很像?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he very much the way you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.60,0:47:34.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.02,0:47:38.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 数据向皮卡特船长报告 - 讲 数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Data to Captain Picard. - Go ahead, Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.56,0:47:39.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.64,0:47:43.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,郭蒂和我已经确定了未授权的电脑访问的来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geordi and I have identified the source of the unauthorized computer access.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.15,0:47:47.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,并且我相信我们已经发现了一种赢得战术优势的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I believe we have found a way to gain a tactical advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.44,0:47:48.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.08,0:48:03.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,维尔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.54,0:48:08.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,作为飞船的顾问 我建议你去睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As ship's counselor, I recommend you get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.47,0:48:11.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,度些蜜月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.76,0:48:18.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,到床上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.77,0:48:21.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,因扎蒂 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imzadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.25,0:48:47.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,因扎蒂 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imzadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.76,0:48:52.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,他决不会像我这样了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can never know you as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.97,0:48:55.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,他决不会像我这样触摸你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can never touch you as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.18,0:48:58.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这不是真的 - 感觉一下我的嘴唇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This isn't real! - Then feel my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.86,0:49:08.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我和你在一起 因扎蒂 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with you, imzadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.82,0:49:11.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我会一直和你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll always be with you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.32,0:49:15.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这不是真的! - 蒂安娜...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This isn't real! - Deanna, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.87,0:49:17.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不! - 蒂安娜?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Deanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.16,0:49:19.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 蒂安娜! - 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Deanna! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.25,0:49:26.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,连接中断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bond has been broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.55,0:49:31.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,再找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:36.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,执政官 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praetor,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.64,0:49:39.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到了异频雷达收发机信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've received the transponder signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.15,0:49:54.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,它正在恶化 我们没时间玩游戏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's accelerating. You have no more time for games.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.03,0:50:00.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,叫医生准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have the doctors prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.97,0:50:16.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,传输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.52,0:50:27.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,开始下载\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begin the download.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.25,0:50:47.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,茶 热的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tea, hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.30,0:51:05.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,除了轻微的肾上腺素和复合胺过高外 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aside from slightly elevated levels of adrenalin and serotonin,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.98,0:51:07.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,你相当正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're perfectly normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.98,0:51:15.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,蒂安娜 你能描述一下吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deanna, can you describe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.65,0:51:16.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.57,0:51:21.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像一场强奸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a violation.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.49,0:51:27.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,辛藏总督好像有能力进入我的思维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shinzon's viceroy seems to have the ability to reach into my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.66,0:51:31.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经成为一个负担 我要求解除我的职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've become a liability. I request to be relieved of my duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.63,0:51:33.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,拒绝请求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.17,0:51:37.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能忍受更多这样的攻击 我需要你在我身旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can endure more of these assaults, I need you at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.80,0:51:39.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在比以前更需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.84,0:51:42.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,企业号 远离联邦空间并且... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise is far from Federation space...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.64,0:51:46.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃夫! 升起防护罩!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worf, shields up!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.32,0:51:59.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好 吉恩·卢克.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Jean-Luc.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.57,0:52:04.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么在这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I here? Why have you done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:06.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很孤独\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.76,0:52:21.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想要干什么? - 我需要你血液样品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you going to do? - I need a sample of your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.76,0:52:27.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的博格朋友们说过什么? "一切抵抗都是徒劳"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it your Borg friends say? "Resistance is futile."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.77,0:52:36.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是的... 机器人 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, the android.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.11,0:52:43.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不能拒绝的诱饵 - 所有这一切都是为了能抓到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The bait you couldn't refuse. - All of this so you could capture me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.07,0:52:45.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要这么自负了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be so vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.87,0:52:51.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我们发现它后 我们做了一些必要的修改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After we found it, we had to make a few modifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.96,0:52:55.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个附加的记忆接口 一个隐藏的异频雷达收发机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An extra memory port, a hidden transponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.79,0:52:59.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们已经得到了访问星际舰队通讯协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've now gained access to Starfleet's communications protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.92,0:53:03.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我现在知道你们整个舰队的确切位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I now know the exact location of your entire fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.97,0:53:07.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你可以走了 - 去那儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You may go. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.68,0:53:12.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,滚出我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.77,0:53:18.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,这一切都是为了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.44,0:53:22.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了命运 皮卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about destiny, Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.44,0:53:25.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 为了被排斥的瑞曼人 - 你不是瑞曼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's about a Reman outcast. - You're not Reman!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.99,0:53:30.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也不是完全的人类 那么我是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not quite human. So what am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.12,0:53:35.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要你还活着我的生命就毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My life is meaningless as long as you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.38,0:53:39.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你存在的时候 我是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I while you exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.34,0:53:43.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个影子? 一个回声?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A shadow? An echo?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.47,0:53:46.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你问题是和我有关 那就单独对付我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your issues are with me, then deal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.14,0:53:49.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,这和我的飞船没有关系 和联邦没有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This has nothing to do with my ship. Nothing to do with the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.64,0:53:51.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 但是确实有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.77,0:53:55.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们将再也不像奴隶一样在任何人面前太不起头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will no longer bow before anyone as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.23,0:53:58.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,既不在罗穆卢斯人面前 也不在你们强大的联邦面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the Romulans, and not your mighty Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.65,0:54:06.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是为战争和征服而存在的种族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are a race bred for war and conquest.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.24,0:54:09.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你准备好了为把整个宇宙拖进战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to plunge the entire quadrant into war
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.33,0:54:12.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,来满足你自己个人邪恶的心的准备了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to satisfy your own personal demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.58,0:54:15.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对你对自己了解的那么少而感到惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It amazes me how little you know yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.83,0:54:19.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我绝不会那么做! - 你是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm incapable of such an act. - You are me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.38,0:54:28.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,同样高贵的皮卡特族血液流淌在我们的血管里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same noble Picard blood runs through our veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.64,0:54:33.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你经历过我的生活 你也会像我这样做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had you lived my life, you'd be doing exactly as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.10,0:54:39.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以看看镜子吧 看看你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So look in the mirror. See yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.78,0:54:44.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,考虑一下吧 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider that, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.20,0:54:48.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想对你来说已经没有什么更大的痛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can think of no greater torment for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.83,0:54:57.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,辛藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shinzon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.62,0:55:00.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,对你来说我也是你的一面镜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a mirror for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.76,0:55:06.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,不会太久了 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for long, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.55,0:55:09.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你无法活着目睹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid you won't survive to witness
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.43,0:55:13.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的胜利了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the victory of the echo over the voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.41,0:55:32.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的隐形太完美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His cloak is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.24,0:55:35.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有超光速粒子发射 没有剩余的反质子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tachyon emissions, no residual antiprotons.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.91,0:55:38.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,好好监视 郭蒂 找到入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep at it, Geordi. Find a way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.84,0:55:51.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,执政官辛藏要见犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praetor Shinzon needs the prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.40,0:56:05.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 很准时 数据先生 - 我的任务就是成功 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- About time, Mr.Data. - My mission was a success, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.36,0:56:09.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了射线来源的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've located the source of the radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.11,0:56:13.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,整个飞船本质上就是一个瑟拉昂射线发动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This entire ship is essentially a thalaron generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.62,0:56:16.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,它的动力在驾驶台上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its power relays lead to an activation matrix on the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.45,0:56:18.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是个武器 - 看起来是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a weapon. - It would appear so.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.95,0:56:20.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,下载怎么样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the download?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.33,0:56:23.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,辛藏相信他已经获得了通讯协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shinzon believes he has our communication protocols.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.13,0:56:26.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是他得到的所有星际舰队飞船的位置都是错误的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will give him inaccurate locations for all Starfleet vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.42,0:56:28.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 干得好 - 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good work. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.51,0:56:35.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,郭蒂给了我一个原型的紧急传输单元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geordi supplied me with a prototype for the Emergency Transport Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.97,0:56:40.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你使用这个 长官 返回企业号 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I recommend you use this, sir, to return to the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.81,0:56:44.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 它只能让我们其中一个使用 - 是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It'll only work for one of us. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.03,0:56:53.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找到一个一起逃脱的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find a way off together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.42,0:57:09.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,是运行程序的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time for the procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.94,0:57:26.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走 渺小的人类动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, puny human animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.77,0:57:30.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,少炫耀 数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bit less florid, Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.89,0:58:03.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.86,0:58:16.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,这边 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.07,0:58:20.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,距离我们目前位置94米外有一个穿梭机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a shuttlebay 94 meters from our current position.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.05,0:58:41.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 在那里 长官 - 走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There it is, sir. - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.79,0:59:10.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,数据!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Data!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.79,0:59:14.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,好像有个加了密的安全系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears to have an encrypted security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.80,0:59:17.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你的敏捷 指挥官!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alacrity would be appreciated, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.63,0:59:20.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞曼语是一种最复杂的语言 使用象形文字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reman is a most complex language with pictographs
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.34,0:59:21.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,表示某种动词根... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}representing certain verb roots...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.97,0:59:25.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我发现那非常迷人的时候 数据 我们真的需要把那门打开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While I find that fascinating, Data, we really need that door open!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.47,1:00:08.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,根据飞船载货单 它们是蝎级攻击型飞行物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to the ship's manifest, they're Scorpion-class attack fliers.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.70,1:00:30.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 数据 你想这是干嘛用的? - 推进器口 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Data, what do you imagine this is? - Port thruster, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.83,1:00:33.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要我来驾驶吗 长官?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like me to drive, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.93,1:00:48.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,数据 你能打开穿梭机场的门吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Data, can you open the shuttlebay doors?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.43,1:00:50.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能 长官 他们在外部入口周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative, sir. They've erected a force field
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.77,1:00:52.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,建立了一个力场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}around the external portholes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.10,1:00:55.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么 看来 只有一个出口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, only one way to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.70,1:01:07.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,你认为这是明智之举吗 长官?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think this is a wise course of action, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.45,1:01:09.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们会知道的 数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're about to find out, Data.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.12,1:01:12.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,加强干扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power up the disruptors.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.54,1:01:14.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备 船长 - 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ready, Captain. - Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.12,1:01:55.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,牵引光束 立刻!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tractor beam, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.79,1:02:00.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃夫 用雷达自动跟踪穿梭机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worf, lock on transporters.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.76,1:02:10.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经完成了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have them, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.07,1:02:22.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,这已经走的太远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This has gone far enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.32,1:02:25.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们曾讨论过忍耐 指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we'd discussed patience, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.95,1:02:27.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,矿藏正在逐渐消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine is wearing thin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.99,1:02:30.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们支持你是因为你答应行动 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We supported you because you promised action.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.62,1:02:32.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在 你耽搁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet, you delay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.04,1:02:37.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,企业号非物质的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise is immaterial.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.58,1:02:40.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,在中心区外我们不能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't even make it out of the Neutral Zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.67,1:02:43.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,在两天之内 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in two days
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.46,1:02:47.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,联邦将会无法逆转的被摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Federation will be crippled beyond repair.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.76,1:02:49.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,那能你使满意了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that satisfy you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.14,1:02:52.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.93,1:02:54.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我回来的时候 你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I return,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.39,1:02:57.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,将对关于如何恰当的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and I shall have a little talk
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.73,1:03:00.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,尊重讨论一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about showing proper respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.32,1:03:08.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的脸怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening to his face?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.33,1:03:17.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,指挥官 请稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander, a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.92,1:03:24.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真的准备让你的双手沾满鲜血吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you truly prepared to have your hands drenched in blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.88,1:03:27.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,他并不打算打败地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not planning to defeat Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.92,1:03:29.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,他打算毁灭它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's planning its annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.60,1:03:35.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的罪过将给我们以及我们的后代打上烙印时代相传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his sins will mark us and our children for generations.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.56,1:03:45.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我越深入研究他的DNA 我就越迷惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more I studied his DNA, the more confusing it got.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.19,1:03:47.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,最终 我得出一个唯一的结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally, I could come to only one conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.74,1:03:50.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,辛藏体内建立了临时的RNA序列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shinzon was created with temporal RNA sequencing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.95,1:03:53.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,他被这样设计以便 在某一点 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was designed so that at a certain point
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.12,1:03:55.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,使他的老化过程加速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his aging process could be accelerated
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.58,1:03:57.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,以更快达到你的年龄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to reach your age more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.20,1:04:00.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,他被设计跳过了他30年的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was engineered to skip 30 years of his life.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.42,1:04:03.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是当临时序列没有被激活时 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when the temporal sequencing wasn't activated,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.25,1:04:06.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的细胞结构开始分解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his cellular structure started breaking down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.25,1:04:07.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,他正在死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.59,1:04:09.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,死亡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dying?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.76,1:04:14.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,能为他做点什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can anything be done for him?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.26,1:04:16.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,除了从唯一匹配的捐赠者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing, except a complete transfusion
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.18,1:04:18.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,进行完全的换血 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the only donor with compatible DNA.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.98,1:04:21.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.94,1:04:30.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他还能活多久? - 我不敢确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long does he have? - I can't say for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.61,1:04:33.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是衰退的速度正在加快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the rate of decay seems to be accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.70,1:04:39.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么他会来找我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he'll come for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.94,1:05:08.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.65,1:05:11.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我动不了 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I cannot move. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.20,1:05:16.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只激活了你的感知和交流子程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have only activated your cognitive and communication subroutines.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.62,1:05:18.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.20,1:05:22.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为你很危险 - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because you are dangerous. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.08,1:05:24.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你被设计成来收集信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been programmed to gather information
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.33,1:05:26.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,用来对抗这艘飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that can be used against this ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.50,1:05:30.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.38,1:05:33.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.85,1:05:41.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道有关辛藏反对联邦的计划吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know anything about Shinzon's plans against the Federation?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.44,1:05:44.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.60,1:05:49.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道有关他飞船的战术能力的资料吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any knowledge of the tactical abilities of his ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.07,1:05:51.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.61,1:05:54.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我能动了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I move now?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.66,1:05:56.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.37,1:06:02.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.00,1:06:07.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我必须停止你的激活状态 - 持续多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I must deactivate you. - For how long?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.59,1:06:11.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.21,1:06:14.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,不确定是多... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long is...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.60,1:06:24.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,很久 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A long time, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.31,1:06:29.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,它被称作连锁生物脉冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called a cascading biogenic pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.40,1:06:31.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑟拉昂射线的特性是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The unique properties of thalaron radiation
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.57,1:06:34.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,让能量束几乎无限制的膨胀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}allow the energy beam to expand almost without limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.57,1:06:38.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,取决于它的射线强度 它能环绕一艘飞船或者一颗行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Depending on its radiant intensity, it could encompass a ship or a planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.24,1:06:46.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,他建造一种如此大范围的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would only have built a weapon of such scope
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.87,1:06:48.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,只为了一个目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.88,1:06:53.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他要毁灭地球 - 你是怎么确定的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's going after Earth. - How can you be certain?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.67,1:06:57.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他是怎么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.13,1:07:00.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,毁灭人性 削弱联邦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy humanity, you cripple the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.47,1:07:05.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗穆卢斯星人的侵略 - 无法看穿他的隐形吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Romulans invade. - No way of penetrating his cloak?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.31,1:07:06.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.14,1:07:11.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,因此他能从任何星际战舰仅10米之外擦身而过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he could pass within 10 meters of every ship in Starfleet
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.23,1:07:13.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,而不被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they'd never know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.98,1:07:17.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我们还是有个优势 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do have one advantage, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.78,1:07:20.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,他需要你的血来生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs your blood to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.41,1:07:24.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他可能会先来找你 - 我正指望他来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He might come after you first. - I'm counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.87,1:07:27.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经奉命到1045区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been ordered to Sector 10-45.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.12,1:07:29.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的战舰已经转向到那里和我们会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our fleet has been diverted to meet us there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.50,1:07:33.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 人多力量大 - 是的至少 那是我们所希望的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Strength in numbers. - Yes, at least that's what we hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.92,1:07:36.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要阻止他动用那种武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must not be allowed to use that weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.97,1:07:40.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,其他的事是次要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All other concerns are secondary.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.81,1:07:46.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.52,1:07:53.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.78,1:08:00.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,全体船员 准备战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All hands, battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.63,1:08:16.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,启动力场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate the force field.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.27,1:08:38.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长个人日志 补充\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's Personal Log, supplemental.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.65,1:08:41.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们正全速朝着联邦空间推进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're heading toward Federation space at maximum warp.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.74,1:08:42.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,全体船员众志成城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crew has responded
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.07,1:08:45.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对他们充满了期望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the dedication I've come to expect of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.83,1:08:49.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像千万个其他指挥官在千千万个战场上一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a thousand other commanders on a thousand other battlefields,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.95,1:08:51.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我期待着黎明的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wait for the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.15,1:09:15.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.57,1:09:20.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,只是几个小时的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A matter of hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.99,1:09:25.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们必须开始程序了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must begin the procedure now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.12,1:09:33.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们到达裂口还有多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long until we reach the Rift?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.42,1:09:36.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,7分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.98,1:10:00.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,数据 我们现在的位置在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Data, what's our current position?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.78,1:10:07.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要多久才能和舰队会合?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How soon until we reach the fleet?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.95,1:10:09.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,以我们当前的速度 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At our current velocity,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.37,1:10:13.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们到达1045区大约还要40分钟 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will arrive at Sector 10-45 in approximately 40 minutes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.26,1:10:25.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,“眼下我们透过模糊的玻璃看”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"For now we see but through a glass, darkly."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.43,1:10:29.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 长官? - 他说他是一面镜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir? - He said he is a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.01,1:10:33.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是你的吗 长官? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of you, sir? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.31,1:10:37.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.15,1:10:40.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,虽然你们有相同的遗传结构 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although you share the same genetic structure,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.11,1:10:43.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们生活中的事件造就了一个独特的个体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the events of your life have created a unique individual.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.69,1:10:45.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我经历了他的生活 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had lived his life,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.95,1:10:49.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也有可能会泯灭人性吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is it possible that I would have rejected my humanity?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.32,1:10:51.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,B-4在身体上和我是一模一样的 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The B-4 is physically identical to me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.91,1:10:54.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,并且虽然他的神经线路不够发达 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}although his neural pathways are not as advanced.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.83,1:10:58.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是即使他们先进的 他也不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But even if they were, he would not be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.54,1:11:02.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能这么确定? - 我立志 长官 要不断超越自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How can you be sure? - I aspire, sir, to be better than I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.01,1:11:07.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,B-4不会 辛藏也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-4 does not. Nor does Shinzon.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.68,1:11:12.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在通过贝森裂口 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are passing through the Bassen Rift, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.06,1:11:15.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我们清除它时 投射会返回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The projection will return when we have cleared it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.60,1:11:18.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,它会妨碍我们从星际舰队绘制法传出的上行线吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's interfering with our uplink from Starfleet cartography?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.85,1:11:22.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,裂口影响所有的长途通讯... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Rift affects all long-range...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.52,1:11:25.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克指挥官 进行逃逸操作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Riker, evasive maneuvers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.78,1:11:34.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准目标的武器系统和防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target weapons systems and shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.83,1:11:37.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不想企业号 被摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want the Enterprise destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.56,1:12:06.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能学会在黑暗下看见东西吗 船长?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you learn to see in the dark, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.40,1:12:08.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.65,1:12:11.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,他通过隐形状态开火 我们不能锁定他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's firing from the cloak. We can't get a lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.70,1:12:13.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,他用他第一次射击瘫痪了我们的航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He disabled our warp drive with his first shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.70,1:12:15.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能推进了 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only have impulse, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.58,1:12:18.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃夫先生 准备展开所有移相器 零提升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Worf, prepare a full phaser spread, zero elevation.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.12,1:12:19.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,标记我们所有储备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All banks on my mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.75,1:12:22.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,扫描防护效果 准备 光子鱼雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scan for shield impacts. Stand by photon torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.42,1:12:23.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.59,1:12:25.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.64,1:12:38.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你太慢了 老头子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too slow, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.23,1:12:42.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,攻击模式 辛藏第八号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack pattern Shinzon Theta.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.29,1:13:01.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在失去背部防护!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are losing dorsal shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.41,1:13:03.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,全轴旋转到左舷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full axis rotation to port!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.62,1:13:05.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,发射所有腹部移相器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire all ventral phasers.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.43,1:13:19.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,对单刃刀号 损伤太小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minimal damage to the Scimitar.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.14,1:13:23.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,防守模式 科尔克第五级 让所有防护网联网 郭蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defensive pattern Kirk Epsilon. Get the shields online, Geordi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.48,1:13:25.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经准备了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.15,1:13:28.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,婥维顾问 报告驾驶舱的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Counselor Troi, report to the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.48,1:13:31.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我们有通讯联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we are being hailed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.57,1:13:33.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,接到屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.99,1:13:37.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,皮卡特船长... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Picard,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.91,1:13:42.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,你欢迎我到你的准备室吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will you join me in your Ready Room?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.35,1:14:02.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不能跟踪我的全息发射器 船长 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't trace my holographic emitters, Captain,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.73,1:14:06.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,因此不要在麻烦了 并且你也不能和舰队联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so don't bother. And you can't contact Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.81,1:14:09.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在只有我们俩了 吉恩·卢克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just the two of us now, Jean-Luc.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.07,1:14:11.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,就应该这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As it should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.03,1:14:16.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么在这里? - 来接受你的投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you here? - To accept your surrender.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.03,1:14:19.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我随时都可以轻而易举的把你摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can clearly destroy you at any time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.99,1:14:24.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,减弱你的防护罩 让我把你传输到我的飞船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower your shields and allow me to transport you to my ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.21,1:14:27.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,那企业号呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Enterprise?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.71,1:14:32.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对你的稀奇古怪的船没有兴趣 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have little interest in your quaint vessel, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.17,1:14:34.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 辛藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me, Shinzon.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.93,1:14:41.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的心 你的双手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your heart, your hands,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.64,1:14:44.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼睛和我是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your eyes are the same as mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.10,1:14:49.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,在你体内流动的血液 原料物质都是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blood pumping within you, the raw material is the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.23,1:14:51.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们有同样的潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the same potential.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.48,1:14:55.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是过去了 船长 - 那也能是未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's the past, Captain. - It can be the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.90,1:14:57.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,埋藏在你内心深处 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buried deep within you,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.86,1:14:59.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,在多年的痛苦和愤怒之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beneath all the years of pain and anger,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.07,1:15:02.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有一些东西从来都没有被滋养过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is something that has never been nurtured,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.66,1:15:06.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,潜力能使你成为一个更好的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the potential to make yourself a better man
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.75,1:15:09.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,那才是做人的根本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that is what it is to be human.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.54,1:15:12.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,努力超于自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make yourself more than you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.09,1:15:16.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.88,1:15:19.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.64,1:15:24.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,曾几何时你仰望群星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a time you looked at the stars
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.60,1:15:26.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,梦想那可能是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and dreamed of what might be.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.94,1:15:30.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,幼稚的梦想 船长 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Childish dreams, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.90,1:15:34.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,已经迷失在瑞摩斯星蒂里塞矿藏里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost in the dilithium mines of Remus.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.28,1:15:37.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是现在所见的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am what you see now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.70,1:15:40.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了比那更多的东西 我看到你会是什么样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see more than that. I see what you could be.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.82,1:15:44.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞摩斯星的辛藏和吉恩·卢克·皮卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man who is Shinzon of Remus and Jean-Luc Picard
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.24,1:15:47.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,决不会消灭整个行星上的人口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could never exterminate the population of an entire planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.71,1:15:49.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,他应该比那更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's better than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.46,1:15:52.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是由他的生活决定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is what his life has made him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.00,1:15:57.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你会怎样处理那样的生活呢? 浪费在一片仇恨之中吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what will you do with that life? Waste it in a blaze of hatred?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.05,1:15:59.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有更好的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a better way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.14,1:16:02.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.18,1:16:05.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 不迟 你仍然还有机会 现在做一个正确的决定吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never. You still have a choice. Make the right one now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.97,1:16:10.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能违背我的本性 - 不 你可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't fight what I am. - Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.81,1:16:16.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你展示我真正的本性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you my true nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.32,1:16:19.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的本性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.49,1:16:21.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,当地球毁灭的时候 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as Earth dies, remember:
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.07,1:16:26.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,记住 我将永远是永恒的瑞摩斯星的辛藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will always, forever be Shinzon of Remus.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.00,1:16:31.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的声音将在你的声音逐渐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my voice shall echo through time long after
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.17,1:16:35.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,在记忆中消退之后在时空中长久的回响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yours has faded to a dim memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.61,1:16:59.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,两艘飞船显形 长官 若米兰人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two ships de-cloaking, sir. Romulan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.91,1:17:13.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.34,1:17:21.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想不会再糟了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just when I thought this couldn't get any worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.55,1:17:24.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到通讯联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are being hailed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.64,1:17:27.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,接到屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.56,1:17:33.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,皮卡特船长 维多号 战舰指挥官德纳储\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Picard, Commander Donatra of the warbird Valdore.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.56,1:17:35.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们能提供援助吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might we be of assistance?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.73,1:17:39.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,援助?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assistance?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.23,1:17:42.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,帝国考虑到事关国内安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Empire considers this a matter of internal security.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.40,1:17:45.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们很遗憾你们被卷了进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We regret you've become involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.83,1:17:51.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,指挥官 这场战斗结束后 我请你喝一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander, when this is over, I owe you a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.41,1:17:55.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,若米兰啤酒 船长 让我们开始工作吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romulan ale, Captain. Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.67,1:17:57.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们都听见女士说的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard the lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.92,1:17:59.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我们开始工作吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.27,1:18:16.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃夫先生 调整我们的攻击和维多号 战术指挥官一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr.Worf, coordinate our attack with the Valdore Tactical Officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.48,1:18:18.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,形成在防护罩效果下三角攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Triangulate all fire on any shield impacts.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.77,1:18:19.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.49,1:18:31.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,后防护罩降低到40％\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aft shields down to 40%.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.49,1:18:34.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,保持我们的船首正对单刃刀号 向前防护罩补充能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep our bow on the Scimitar. Auxiliary power to forward shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.79,1:18:36.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.30,1:18:49.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准侧翼战舰 运送我标记的所有干扰储备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target the flanking warbird. All forward disruptor banks on my mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.28,1:19:12.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 前防护罩降低到10％ - 把我们的头掉过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Forward shields down to 10%. - Bring us about.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.21,1:19:26.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,放下后舱门部分隐形 准备紧急停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop cloak on the aft port quadrant. Prepare for full emergency stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.84,1:19:29.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 你听见我说的了吗!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - You heard me!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.35,1:19:43.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,他正在失去他的隐形 准备运送所有干扰储备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's losing his cloak. Stand by all forward disruptor banks.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.15,1:19:47.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,她就在我们上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's almost on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.24,1:19:51.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.04,1:19:58.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 还没有 - 全停 开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Praetor. - Full stop. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.14,1:20:22.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,恢复后部隐形并把头掉转过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Restore the aft cloak and bring us about.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.90,1:20:29.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕那杯酒不得不等等了 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that drink will have to wait, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.65,1:20:32.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有生命支持吗? - 目前还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have life support? - For the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.07,1:20:36.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是我们会死在水里的 - 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But we're dead in the water. - Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.75,1:20:47.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在失去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're losing structural integrity
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.67,1:20:50.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,从12到17号甲板 4到10区的结构整体性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on Decks 12 through 17, sections 4 through 10.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.72,1:20:56.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,开启紧急力场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency Force fields are holding.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.10,1:20:59.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,撤掉那些甲板 并把场能转送到前防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evacuate those decks. Re-route field power to forward shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.23,1:21:05.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.31,1:21:07.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想我有办法找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I may have a way to find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.28,1:21:14.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备侧向运转 启动所有右舷干扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for a lateral run, all starboard disruptors.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.33,1:21:23.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.96,1:21:26.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.42,1:21:29.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,她在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.24,1:22:02.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在抵抗我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's resisting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.97,1:22:17.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.01,1:22:22.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,记住我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.19,1:22:26.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,立即!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.70,1:22:37.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,任意开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire at will.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.96,1:22:52.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备登船把皮卡特给我带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare a boarding party. Bring me Picard.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.30,1:22:56.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.80,1:23:00.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,恢复隐形!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the cloak back!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.85,1:23:04.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准所有防护罩坐标 β3 所有干扰 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target all shield coordinates, Beta-3. All disruptors fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.90,1:23:17.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我们失去了在29号甲板的中部防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we've lost ventral shielding on Deck 29!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.40,1:23:19.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,转移所有动力和补给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Divert all power and compensate.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.83,1:23:27.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 入侵警报 - 大副\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Intruder alert. - Number One.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.25,1:23:30.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 详细报告29号甲板安全情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - Security detail to Deck 29.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.77,1:23:52.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗穆卢斯人为荣誉而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Romulans fought with honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.61,1:23:55.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 沃夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they did, Mr.Worf.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.90,1:24:38.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃夫 掩护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worf, cover me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.91,1:26:12.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,医疗队请到驾驶室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medical teams to the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.93,1:26:29.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.14,1:26:31.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们耗尽了我们所有补充的光子鱼雷弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have exhausted our complement of photon torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.85,1:26:33.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,移相器储备减少到4% 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phaser banks are down to 4%, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.77,1:26:37.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们用集中模式把我们所有移相器瞄准会怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we targeted all our phasers in a concentrated pattern?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.27,1:26:41.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,单刃刀号的防护罩依然在70% 那没有什么差别 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Scimitar shields are still at 70%. It would make no difference, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.37,1:26:52.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,他正在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.80,1:27:07.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,他想看看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to look me in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.76,1:27:13.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们逮住他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.64,1:27:20.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,他认为他确切的知道我将做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks he knows exactly what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.27,1:27:23.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,郭蒂 把所有动力转移到引擎上 把生命支持拿走 如果必要的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geordi, divert all power to the engines. Take it from life support, if you have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.98,1:27:26.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,把你得到所有都给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.78,1:27:31.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.20,1:27:34.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们接到通讯联络 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are being hailed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.33,1:27:37.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,蒂安娜 准备 打开一个通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deanna, stand by. Open a channel.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.83,1:27:44.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我希望你依然活着 吉恩·卢克 - 哦 是的 我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hope you're still alive, Jean-Luc. - Oh. Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.46,1:27:47.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不认为是投降的时候了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think it's time to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.34,1:27:49.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你的船员必须死?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should the rest of your crew have to die?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.14,1:27:52.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,辛藏 我想我没有告诉过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shinzon, I don't think I ever told you
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.06,1:27:55.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,关于我的第一个学院评估\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about my first Academy evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.39,1:27:59.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,特别是 我被认为是极端的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In particular, I was thought to be extremely
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.19,1:28:01.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,自负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}overconfident.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.48,1:28:06.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我很乐意听你高谈阔论 我真的以为... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, as much as I enjoy listening to you talk, I really think...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.95,1:28:12.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,标记我的记录 蒂安娜 全体船员 准备撞击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my mark, Deanna. All hands, brace for impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.04,1:28:16.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.47,1:28:37.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,左满舵!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard to port!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.86,1:30:10.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,把所有动力转换到引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Divert all power to the engines.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.61,1:30:14.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,全速后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full reverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.08,1:31:50.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在重新装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reconfiguring now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.00,1:31:57.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,电脑 准备自毁程序Ω\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, stand by auto-destruct sequence Omega.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.76,1:32:00.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,确认吉恩·卢克·皮卡特的声音模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognize voice pattern Jean-Luc Picard.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.09,1:32:03.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,授权: α－α－3－0－5\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Authorization: Alpha-Alpha-3-0-5.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.72,1:32:07.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,自毁程序中断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Auto-destruct is offline.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.04,1:32:31.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,干扰没有起作用 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disruptors are not functional, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.13,1:32:36.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,配置武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploy the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.47,1:32:41.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,毁了那艘船上的所有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill everything on that ship,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.80,1:32:44.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后确定一个到地球路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then set a course for Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.51,1:32:47.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须完成我们的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must complete our mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.70,1:33:06.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,矩阵启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matrix initiated.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.79,1:33:13.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,激活瑟拉昂射线传送的排列程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sequencing procedure for thalaron radiation transfer activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.26,1:33:23.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,有些理想是值得我们献出生命 不是吗 吉恩·卢克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some ideals are worth dying for, aren't they, Jean-Luc?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.02,1:33:40.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑟拉昂混合程序启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thalaron intermix procedure initiated.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.28,1:33:44.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,开始配置目标武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deployment of targeting arms commencing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.93,1:34:10.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,离开火还有多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long until he can fire?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.94,1:34:17.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,目标序列应该在大约7分钟后启动 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The targeting sequence should take about seven minutes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.73,1:34:20.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,当目标武器全部配置好后 在驾驶室的矩阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the targeting arms are fully deployed,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.19,1:34:23.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,将传递瑟拉昂射线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the matrix on the Bridge will relay the thalaron radiation
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.28,1:34:25.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,集中到他们顶端的射击点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the firing points at their tips.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.82,1:34:28.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,企业号 上没有人能幸存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one on the Enterprise will survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.08,1:34:37.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他能怎么样? 他会杀了你的 - 再也不和我相关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How can he? He'll kill you. - It's not about me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.09,1:34:42.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备点对点传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for a site-to-site transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.45,1:34:44.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我认为不要进行传送...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think that the transport...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.63,1:34:46.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是命令 指挥官 - 长官 让我去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's an order, Commander. - Sir, allow me to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.05,1:34:49.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 数据 这是我必须做的 - 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Data, this is something I have to do. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.43,1:34:51.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 数据 - 你来驾驶 指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Data. - You have the Bridge, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.93,1:34:54.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,在你和单刃刀号之间尝试保持距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try and put some distance between you and the Scimitar.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.77,1:34:58.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 赶快 拉佛吉先生 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, Mr.La Forge. - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.53,1:35:11.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,完了 传送器坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Transporters are down.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.75,1:35:18.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,系统有保险丝装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}System is fused.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.83,1:35:22.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,婥维顾问 请下达指令 郭蒂 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Counselor Troi, please assume command. Geordi, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.39,1:36:22.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑟拉昂混合等级: 30%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thalaron intermix level: 30%.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.63,1:36:51.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,4分钟后达到发射序列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four minutes to firing sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.92,1:37:35.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑟拉昂混合等级: 50%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thalaron intermix level: 50%.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.40,1:37:50.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,3分钟后达到发射序列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes to firing sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.63,1:38:14.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑟拉昂混合等级: 60%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thalaron intermix level: 60%.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.44,1:39:15.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,2分钟后达到发射序列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes to firing sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.05,1:39:42.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑟拉昂混合等级: 80%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thalaron intermix level: 80%.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.33,1:40:10.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴我们现在在一起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad we're together now.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.79,1:40:14.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的命运完整了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our destiny is complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.97,1:40:28.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,1分钟后达到发射序列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute to firing sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.31,1:40:34.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑟拉昂混合等级 完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thalaron intermix level completed.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.83,1:40:53.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,30秒后达到发射序列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}30 seconds to firing sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.72,1:41:08.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.39,1:41:11.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,十 九 八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten, nine, eight,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.31,1:41:15.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,七 六 五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seven, six, five,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.98,1:41:19.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,四 三 二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}four, three, two...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.43,1:41:46.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,数据?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Data?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.54,1:42:18.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.22,1:42:26.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,是数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Data.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.66,1:42:49.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我们收到通讯联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we're being hailed.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.24,1:42:51.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,接到屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On-screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.50,1:42:56.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,打开一个频道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open a channel.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.67,1:43:00.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是维多号 指挥官德纳储\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Commander Donatra of the Valdore.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.25,1:43:04.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在派遣携带医疗人员和供给的穿梭机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're dispatching shuttles with medical personnel and supplies.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.93,1:43:08.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.89,1:43:12.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,今天你在若米兰帝国你赢得个朋友 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've earned a friend in the Romulan Empire today, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.77,1:43:15.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望这是许多中的第一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope, the first of many.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.56,1:43:18.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,维多号 中断通讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Valdore out.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.07,1:43:27.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,郭蒂 准备穿梭机到达的机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geordi, prepare the shuttlebay for arrivals.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.70,1:43:33.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们 呃 他们不知道我们的程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't know our procedures.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.71,1:43:38.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 把门打开就行了 - 我会处理的 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just open the doors. - I'll take care of it, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.00,1:43:41.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,你来控制驾驶 大副\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the Bridge, Number One.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.94,1:44:00.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.74,1:44:14.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,为缺席的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To absent friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.37,1:44:20.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,为家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To family.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.69,1:44:42.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次见到数据的时候 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First time I saw Data,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.86,1:44:45.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,他正在靠在全息舱的一棵树上学吹口哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was leaning against a tree in the holodeck, trying to whistle.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.94,1:44:49.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是我见过最搞笑的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funniest thing I ever saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.99,1:44:54.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,无论他怎么做 他都不能吹出正确的调子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what he did, he couldn't get the tune right.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.37,1:44:58.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么歌?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that song?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.58,1:45:03.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,不记得那歌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't remember the song.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.86,1:45:34.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.37,1:45:39.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 维尔 - 请求登陆 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will. - Permission to disembark, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.79,1:45:42.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.58,1:45:46.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么 泰坦号 离开去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where's the Titan off to?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.75,1:45:48.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,中心区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Neutral Zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.80,1:45:50.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们将领导新的特遣部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're heading up the new task force.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.67,1:45:53.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,显然 若米兰人对谈话很感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, the Romulans are interested in talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.93,1:45:56.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,呃 对这工作我想不起更合适的人选了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't think of a better man for the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.60,1:46:01.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以问一下 你的第一个命令只是个建议吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may, just a word of advice about your first command?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.60,1:46:03.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.19,1:46:08.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,当你的大副坚持你不能离开使命... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When your First Officer insists that you can't go on away missions...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.15,1:46:11.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,别理他 我正打算这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ignore him. I intend to.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.99,1:46:20.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,和你一起工作是种荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serving with you has been an honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.37,1:46:26.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,是我的荣誉 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The honor was mine, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.22,1:46:45.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道是否所有这些造成这些感觉 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if all this has made any sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.14,1:46:48.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是我想你知道他应该是什么样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I wanted you to know what kind of man he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.56,1:46:51.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,在他寻求和我们更像的过程中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In his quest to be more like us,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.36,1:46:55.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,他帮助我们看清了做为人类的真正意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he helped us to see what it means to be human.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.16,1:46:59.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.41,1:47:02.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的兄弟不是一个人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother was not human.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.16,1:47:06.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 他不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.25,1:47:09.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是他创造的奇迹 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But his wonder,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.75,1:47:13.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,他对人类本性各方面的好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his curiosity about every facet of human nature
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.80,1:47:17.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我们看清了我们自己本身最好的方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}allowed all of us to see the best parts of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.47,1:47:18.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,他发展了自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He evolved.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.30,1:47:22.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,他接受改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He embraced change
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.56,1:47:25.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为他总想超越自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he always wanted to be better than he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.19,1:47:30.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我... \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.65,1:47:34.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.53,1:47:41.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我希望有一天你能明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hope someday you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.33,1:47:47.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,船长 航线引擎准备待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, the warp engines are ready to go online.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.37,1:47:52.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就来 请通知拉佛吉指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on my way. Please inform Commander La Forge.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.38,1:47:58.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们以后再聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll talk later.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.97,1:48:02.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从来没见过太阳 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Never saw the sun ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.89,1:48:07.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从来没见过太阳 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Never saw the sun ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.77,1:48:13.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从来没见过太阳 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Never saw the sun ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.86,1:48:17.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 照耀出如此光亮 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Shining so bright ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.45,1:48:20.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 照耀出如此光亮 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Shining so bright ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.28,1:48:24.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从来没见过事情 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Never saw things ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.50,1:48:31.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 发展如此顺利 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Going so right ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.75,1:48:33.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 发展如此顺利 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Going so right ∮
